WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:08.472
When both sets of parents get makeup at the same place, the overall tone and balance can be coordinated.

2
00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:15.696
If one looks too heavily made up and the other too light, or their hairstyles clash, they can look mismatched standing side by side.

3
00:00:16.032 --> 00:00:24.792
When a specialist coordinates both looks, the two families come across as polished and put-together standing together in the lobby or in family photos.

4
00:00:25.128 --> 00:00:33.552
Going through a joint pre-consultation and sharing style ideas can also break the ice between in-laws and create a friendlier atmosphere.

5
00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:38.280
The downside is that it can feel awkward if the relationship between the two families is tense.

6
00:00:38.616 --> 00:00:42.672
The embarrassment of running into in-laws bare-faced is another discomfort.

7
00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:50.736
Many parents dislike being seen before makeup, and large shops without separate spaces often fall short on that kind of emotional consideration.

8
00:00:51.072 --> 00:00:54.072
Psychological comparison and a competitive undertone can't be ignored either.

9
00:00:54.408 --> 00:01:03.672
If one parent looks noticeably younger or more striking, the other may feel comparatively self-conscious, which can even affect their expression on the day.

10
00:01:04.008 --> 00:01:08.856
One parent may also feel uncomfortable revealing something like thinning hair in front of the other.
